 "notes": [
  "200 critical records 2021-2025, 40 per year by simple random sampling within year; codebook verbatim from the classifier prompt; one coder blinded to model labels (frozen protocol, Multimedia Appendix 1, Note 9). Set-based comparison per record. Weighted: each record weighted by frame size / sample size of its year. CIs: percentile bootstrap within year (1000, seed 42). Insufficient support: fewer than 10 human-positive records. In the primary analysis the 13 records with no human theme count as empty sets, so every model theme on them is a false positive (Amendment 1, made after the pre-specified analysis had been run)."
